PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790262018
OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,F"I don't think it's fair for football
OL,7,Ffans to be singled out in that way and
OL,8,FI made that point. I think that
OL,9,Flegislation dates to an era where
OL,10,Ffootball was very different," Burnham
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,F"And I do believe there is a case to
OL,14,Fremove that discrimination. There are
OL,15,Fdifferent ways it could be done,
OL,16,Fperhaps on a trial basis.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790262018
OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,F"But I'm not going to back away from
OL,7,Fwhat's been a long-held view of mine.
OL,8,FI don't see how it can be fair that
OL,9,Fsome supporters of one sport can be
OL,10,Ftreated differently from others."
OL,12,FThe Football Supporters' Association
OL,13,F(FSA) welcomed the PM's words and said
OL,14,Fsuccessful pilots of alcohol in the
OL,15,Fstands had been carried out in the
OL,16,Fwomen's game.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
