OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,F"The FSA has always argued that it's
OL,7,Funfair to criminalise football fans
OL,8,Ffor having a pint while watching the
OL,9,Fmatch ` especially since you can sit
OL,10,Fin the same seat drinking alcohol
OL,11,Fwhilst watching an Oasis gig or rugby
OL,12,Fleague," chairman Tom Greatrex said.
OL,14,F"Many clubs are in favour as well. WSL
OL,15,Fand WSL2 ran a successful pilot,
OL,16,Fmeaning fans can now drink in the
OL,17,Fstands at many grounds, while the EFL
OL,18,Fhas long supported a trial.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
