OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,F"We welcome the prime minister's
OL,12,Fcomments and totally agree that the
OL,13,Flegislation is outdated and deserves
OL,14,Fto be reviewed. We look forward to
OL,15,Fbeing part of that consultation."
OL,17,FThe Sporting Events (Control of
OL,18,FAlcohol) Act 1985 prohibits drinking
OL,19,Fin sight of the pitch in England and
OL,20,FWales in the top five men's leagues.
