OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,FPolice chiefs warned it would be
OL,7,F"incredibly rash" to make changes to
OL,8,Fthe rules without proper consultation
OL,9,Ffirst.
OL,11,FA UK Football Policing Unit spokesman
OL,12,Fsaid they would welcome a meeting with
OL,13,FBurnham to "explain the challenges
OL,14,Fthese proposed changes would bring to
OL,15,Fpolicing and the safety of staff and
OL,16,Ffans".
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@QO]uD@LOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/10
