OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790262018
OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,F"Other sports simply don't see the
OL,7,Fviolence and criminal behaviour from
OL,8,Ftheir supporters that football does,
OL,9,Falbeit a minority, with alcohol often
OL,10,Fplaying a significant part in violent
OL,11,Fand disorderly behaviour," the
OL,12,Fspokesperson said.
OL,14,F"It would be irresponsible to fuel
OL,15,Fthis by allowing greater alcohol
OL,16,Fconsumption during games.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
