PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1790262018
OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,F"Following a number of football-
OL,7,Frelated tragedies, changes in
OL,8,Flegislation were implemented after the
OL,9,FTaylor Report for good reason and we
OL,10,Fare currently in the longest ever
OL,11,Fperiod without a significant football-
OL,12,Frelated disaster.
OL,14,F"It would be incredibly rash to make
OL,15,Ffundamental changes without a full
OL,16,Fexamination of the evidence and
OL,17,Fmeaningful consultation with police
OL,18,Fpractitioners who have the expertise
OL,19,Fin this area."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU{D@NO]
