OL,3,CDrinking bans during football matches
OL,4,Cshould be scrapped, Burnham says
OL,6,FBurnham previously raised the issue
OL,7,Fbefore he entered No 10 in July, when
OL,8,Frugby league fans were able to drink
OL,9,Fwhile watching matches at Everton's
OL,10,FHill Dickinson Stadium.
OL,12,FWhile at the grounds, he said: "How
OL,13,Fcome these lads can do that in my seat
OL,14,Fhere when we can't do that at an
OL,15,FEverton home game? Something wrong
OL,16,Fthere. I think we need to look at
OL,17,Fthat."
